Well, having at least one food ration is a Good Thing; consider that even
if your god is happy with you, immediately after you got an artifact you
usually (generally?) cannot safely pray. It happens often to me that just
after I got Grimtooth (or whatever) I became hungry and couldn't pray when
weak. Otherwise make sure you are close to the Mines or close to Sokoban;
the former has plenty of fresh food to hunt, the latter some durable food.

